    prompt "Command port of the RGB panel"
    default DISPLAY_DEFAULT_RGB_CMD_C3
    help
      The command port of an RGB panel is slow and used during initialization only: it is driven by software on
      GPIOs (the software DBI Type C bus), chip select included.
